WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:23.990
Bird lived in a perfect tree.

2
00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:31.273
"I love my tree," she said.

3
00:00:31.274 --> 00:00:35.077
"It's in a nice quiet park.

4
00:00:35.078 --> 00:00:43.397
And I can see the ocean."

5
00:00:43.398 --> 00:00:48.137
One day Bird was sleeping.

6
00:00:48.138 --> 00:00:51.112
Boom! Bonk!

7
00:00:51.113 --> 00:00:54.663
"What made that sound?" asked Bird.

8
00:00:54.664 --> 00:00:58.596
Bird looked up, but she didn't see anything.

9
00:00:58.597 --> 00:01:01.187
Bird went back to sleep.

10
00:01:01.188 --> 00:01:03.135
Boom! Bonk!

11
00:01:03.136 --> 00:01:07.154
"Ouch!" said Bird.

12
00:01:07.155 --> 00:01:10.088
Bird looked up again.

13
00:01:10.089 --> 00:01:13.095
But she still didn't see anything.

14
00:01:13.096 --> 00:01:17.271
Bird went back to sleep again.

15
00:01:17.272 --> 00:01:26.193
Crash! Bonk! Boom!

16
00:01:26.194 --> 00:01:30.638
"Acorns!" cried Bird.

17
00:01:30.639 --> 00:01:34.285
"Where did these come from?"

18
00:01:34.286 --> 00:01:37.201
Bird looked up and saw a chipmunk.

19
00:01:37.202 --> 00:01:40.233
"Sorry," said the chipmunk.

20
00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:43.928
"Oh, that's okay," said Bird.

21
00:01:43.929 --> 00:01:48.382
"What are you doing with all these acorns?"

22
00:01:48.383 --> 00:01:51.379
"I'm moving in," said the chipmunk.

23
00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.669
"You're moving in?" asked Bird.

24
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.140
"Yes," said the chipmunk.

25
00:01:59.141 --> 00:02:03.475
"I'm moving in to this hole.

26
00:02:03.476 --> 00:02:15.395
My name is Kip. I'm your new neighbor!"
